{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magi, spirits and occultists clash with colorful crystal orbs and explosive teleportation! Mystics Ablaze is a deep and spectacular couch fighting game for 2-4 players unlike anything you\u2019ve ever played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>AWAKEN YOUR 7th SENSE</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystics Ablaze is fast-paced and mechanically deep, yet requires very little memorization and training compared to other fighting games, with great emphasis placed on creativity and mechanical exploration. Learn together by playing together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/6ccceefccded22cad966f529bbdd54ba.poster.avif?t=1766261739\" width=782 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/6ccceefccded22cad966f529bbdd54ba.webm?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/6ccceefccded22cad966f529bbdd54ba.mp4?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>EMBRACE THE STORM</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in Mystics Ablaze embodies a new way of thinking and approaching the game. They are packed with unique powers, gimmicks and anomalies with simple rules that create deep and explosive connotations. Wield your creativity to gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/591bdd64446ca042987186fd15866968.poster.avif?t=1766261739\" width=782 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/591bdd64446ca042987186fd15866968.webm?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/591bdd64446ca042987186fd15866968.mp4?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>EVOCATIVE SIGHTS AND SOUNDS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dark swamps to firelit carnivals, step into a strange, magical world. Feel the pulse of the game with an otherworldly and lovingly crafted soundtrack as your burning spirits light up the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/3c1c6e6a9c048069bbc12280a0804a4d.poster.avif?t=1766261739\" width=782 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/3c1c6e6a9c048069bbc12280a0804a4d.webm?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/3c1c6e6a9c048069bbc12280a0804a4d.mp4?t=1766261739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>GATHER YOUR FRIENDS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a roster of distinctive, deep characters and endless opportunities for player expression, Mystics Ablaze is a game to gather your friends around and return to time and time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865560/extras/2342116750aec5bedeb5085e9a85374f.post